# Saved reports are a client-side route, so the SPA shell has to answer /r/<id>.
# This is scoped to /r/* rather than /*: Workers Static Assets rejects a catch-all
# to /index.html as an infinite loop, because it strips `.html` and `/index` and
# re-enters the same rule. On the Worker, assets.not_found_handling already covers
# this; the rule is what gives the Pages target the same behaviour.
/r/* /index.html 200
